   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Both... and...",
     "texto": [
      "**Как** («both») ... **так и** («and»): **Как дети, так и взрослые любят музыку** («Both children and adults love music»). Both parts include the two groups."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Neither... nor...",
     "texto": [
      "**Ни** + word, **ни** + word: **Ни брат, ни сестра не пришли** («Neither my brother nor my sister came»). With two subjects, the verb goes in the plural if it is in the present or future: **Ни брат, ни сестра не пойдут** («Neither my brother nor my sister will go»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Either... or...",
     "texto": [
      "**Либо... либо...** («either... or...»): **Либо ты идёшь, либо остаёшься** («Either you go or you stay»). It is more formal than **или... или...**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
